          "tags": [],
          "text": "Audit what `try.sage` welcome ships today (`TrySage*` components in `app/src/lib/components/`): copy, imagery, tutorial-step cards, layout, animations."
        },
        {
          "checked": false,
          "line_num": 363,
          "tags": [],
          "text": "Identify which pieces are *trial-only* (banner countdown, persona switcher, magic-link QR) vs. *generally useful for any first-run* (welcome card, \"what to try first\" buttons, tutorial overlay, branded slideshow continuity)."
