        "#bonsai"
      ],
      "text": "**Delete the chromadb pip fallback (end-state of the bootstrap): blocked on prod-registry cutover + one release of soak. `vector_bootstrap.py` already prefers the sprig; the pip path goes cold automatically once prod has a registry.**\n`#bonsai`\n`TODO.md:L174`",
